 "system": "b2_nonadaptive",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've got a cough, and pain on my right side."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When did your cough and the pain on your right side first start?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It started two days ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, not that I know of. My daughter sorts my tablets."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "If you put a number on how bad things feel for you right now, from 0 for not bad at all up to 10 for the worst you can imagine, what number would you give it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Maybe a five. It's worse when I cough."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, never had an operation."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Along with the cough and the pain on your right side, has anything else been going on?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've been feeling a bit sick."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Does the pain on your right side stay with you all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It only comes on when I cough."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What worries you most about what’s been going on?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I just hope it's nothing serious."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When the pain comes on, what does it feel like?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's just a sore pain. My son came round yesterday."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else about your health in the past you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How have you been sleeping lately?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've not noticed any trouble sleeping."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides feeling a bit sick, is there anything else you've noticed?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've had aches all over my body."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I don't know the names, my daughter sorts them out."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you can tell me about your medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I can't remember, sorry."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Other than your high blood pressure, are there any other health problems from your past you'd like to mention?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I had pneumonia last year, but it cleared up."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’d like to add about your medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've got macular degeneration too, in my eyes."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’ve noticed along with the cough and the pain on your right side?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I felt feverish with chills last night."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
